'''8bit''' is a [[Common Weapons|Common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 2]] or through trading.
==Appearance==
Its blade is silver with an 8-bit texture over it, hence the name. Imprinted on the blade are patches of red 8bit pixels. The guard is silver, and the handle is solid black. The unreleased version appears visually identical except that the 8-bit pixels on the blade are light blue and green in color instead of red.

==Trivia==
*8bit’s unreleased version was published to the Roblox Library by [[Nikilis]] on April 22, 2021.<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/6711880940/8bitNew The model of the unreleased version]</ref>

